<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND 172 ALL OUT V AUSTRALIA, 4TH TEST - LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 172 ALL OUT V AUSTRALIA, 4TH TEST - LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>LEEDS, England 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were bowled out for 172 a few minutes before lunch on the second day of the fourth test against Australia at Headingley on Friday.</p>
</text>
